sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User/Browser
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant GL as GitLab API

    U->>FE: Öffnet "Projekte"
    FE->>BE: GET /projects  (Authorization: app_token)
    BE->>BE: Validiert app_token -> resolve gitlab_access_token
    BE->>GL: GET /groups/:groupId/projects?with_shared=false&archived=false&per_page=100
    GL-->>BE: [ {id, path, name, ...} ]

    loop Für jedes Projekt
        BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/repository/tree?path=packages&per_page=100
        GL-->>BE: [ package-Folder ... ]
        BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id  (oder /projects/:id/repository/branches/main bzw. commits)
        GL-->>BE: { name, description, default_branch, ... }
        BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/repository/commits?ref_name=main&per_page=1
        GL-->>BE: [{ committed_date }]
        BE->>BE: Map auf {packageName, title, lastModified}
    end

    BE-->>FE: 200 [ {repo-id, packageName, title, lastModified}... ]
    FE-->>U: Liste rendern (Sortierung nach lastModified)
